  "about": "Plan 188: what counts as a poll vote. A message counts only when its whole text (trimmed of Unicode White_Space and U+FEFF) is one ASCII digit 1..optionCount, optionally followed by U+FE0F and/or U+20E3 (the keycap emoji). `expected` is the 1-based option number, or null for chat. Rust: cargo test -p videorc-backend polls::tests::vote_fixture. TypeScript: pnpm --filter @videorc/desktop test -- poll-votes.test.ts",
